{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmzj1dmXqHHLQ6thHdeZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd pick the second option, the one that groups everything under each company's name. I'm not very sure, though. It reads the way I think about it: first the company I know, הראל or מור, then one line under its name, \"דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.54% עד 0.61%\". That line tells me how much they take without making me look through a grid.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. The heading and the three option buttons. One of them, \"טבלת חברות מול סוגים\", is marked \"מומלץ\". That's the designers' mark, so it didn't decide anything for me.\n2. **Option 1** opens with \"עוקב מדד s&p 500\", in English letters, at the very top. My first thought was that this isn't for me. After that, every row is a company I know repeating the same thing: \"מניות\", \"מט\"ח\", little yellow and green dots, clocks, \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". I read the same words again on each row just to find the one number that's different. I stopped reading the rows properly after a few.\n3. **Option 2**: I read the הראל heading line and some of the track names. \"הראל גמל להשקעה כספי (שקלי)\" and \"אג\"ח סחיר\" at least sound like something I know. Then I scrolled through the מור group. That's long: I was on the third screen before I reached the second company.\n4. **Option 3**: a big grid with a company on each row and a \"type\" in each column. There's one helpful sentence: \"כתום חזק יותר הוא דמי ניהול גבוהים יותר\". But the oranges and browns look almost the same to me. It's all numbers, and I got nervous. The row for מור did look darker, so I suppose they cost more.\n5. The fifth screen was the first list all over again. I barely looked at it.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- \"s&p 500\", \"מט\"ח\", \"עוקב מדדים\", \"גמיש\", \"קופה\" (the numbers like 13874), \"ההפקדות\" and \"0%\".\n- The rings and the little dots.\n- \"חשיפה\" and what the 99% means. It frightened me a bit.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", and why there is \"מ־3 שנים\" when there's no number next to it.\n\n**What I couldn't read or what wore me out**\n- The small grey line under the big heading, and the orange notes at the bottom (\"בשרטוט בלבד…\") were hard to read.\n- The whole page is dark with pale text.\n- In option 1 the 13.79% and 22.48% figures stuck in my head. Then I saw that 0.54% sits right next to them and they look alike.\n\nI would have stopped around the third screen. I'll ask you or the bank before I do anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3970,"cache_read_input_tokens":18405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3970},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9708086e-bd23-4172-8b8f-160273374b9c","uuid":"9c0579a2-92f5-4c91-9fff-6227824d751b","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:33:15.168Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmzj1RN79EMRKr1Xg3ad"}
